# Round-2 harvested site-energy ensembles.  These 15 kB arrays are the compact
# distillation of ~10 GB of per-frame TeraChem trees and are the sole source of
# every round-2 detuning/coupling number.  They previously existed only in a
# /tmp scratch directory; the broad *.npz rule above must never hide them again.
!terachem_site_energy_cd/results/ensembles/
!terachem_site_energy_cd/results/ensembles/*.npz

# Absolute-CD comparison against Nguyen 2025 Table S3 (predicted vs experimental
# couplet on a common grid); small, and the figure cannot be rebuilt without it.
